   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands Enterprise Agency</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HACCP-certified, semi-processed deep frozen meat products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite the fact that Ethiopia is a meat producing country and meat consumption is quite high, the professional meat processing industry is still at an infancy stage. More than 80% of the cattle marketed is slaughtered unofficially at household level. There are some companies producing semi-processed raw meat in bulk portions, but no companies producing processed, deep-frozen beef and chicken products. Restaurants, hotels and catering companies have to buy raw meat from slaughterhouses and process the meat themselves. Even in the biggest supermarkets only occasionally some imported processed products are available.ED Stelar Trading PLC is a corporate event organising company and faced the lack of hygienic and good quality meat products during the organisation of many high profile African Union events. Together with its partner, Wasmoeth Beheer B.V., it has started the first HACCP proof meat processing company in Addis Ababa. The joint venture will produce and distribute deep frozen steaks, burgers, cutlets, chicken legs, chicken nuggets to hotels, restaurants, catering companies and supermarkets.The company will improve food safety in Ethiopia and professionalise the meat food production chain by also training its suppliers and customers on food safety issues.</narrative>
  </description>
